// prompt: raw memory of a region (Srs.Region): the one refined pointer type of the allocator (vic 2026-11-16: no bare Ptr; Ptr
// only on the RHS of a constrained type). Ptr[U8](0): no byte is readable by srs code; only the allocator prims (rt_ptr_*,
// confined to Srs.Arena.* / Srs.Gate.* / Srs.Pages.* by F5e badPtrArith/badPtrMem) and libc page calls take it.
type Srs.Mem {r: Srs.Region} = Ptr[U8](0)

